From f8afa1a1a86917413816a7c5a44ba12d2b3bfd3d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Tomasz=20Kami=C5=84ski?= <tkaminsk@redhat.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 10:55:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] libstdc++: Update tzdata to 2026f, without leapseconds
 removal.

Import the new 2026f tzdata.zi file. No changes to leapseconds,
as CGPM voted to stop adding new ones, and larger changes are needed.

libstdc++-v3/ChangeLog:
	* src/c++20/tzdata.zi: Import new file from 2026f release.

Reviewed-by: Jonathan Wakely <jwakely@redhat.com>
(cherry picked from commit 9f5edf2dd4d69ca222f218c26bbdbe05ae68f3b0)
---
 libstdc++-v3/src/c++20/tzdata.zi | 21 ++++++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libstdc++-v3/src/c++20/tzdata.zi b/libstdc++-v3/src/c++20/tzdata.zi
index 7ac5fe703a88..f15891f65bb3 100644
--- a/libstdc++-v3/src/c++20/tzdata.zi
+++ b/libstdc++-v3/src/c++20/tzdata.zi
